{
 "id": "person-sjesjai-folk",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/person-sjesjai-folk",
 "offset_seconds": -3.1200000000001893,
 "words_heard": 279,
 "words": 287,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They went up through the Negev and came to Hebron",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where Ahiman and Sheshai lived with Talmai",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Descendants of Anak in the ancient land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The cities were fortified and very large",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Valley of Eshcol they cut a branch",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A single cluster of grapes on a pole between them",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty days they spent in the scouting",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they returned to the Wilderness of Paran",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We even saw the descendants of Anak there",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In our own eyes we seemed like grasshoppers",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land we traveled through devours the living",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And all the people we saw are of enormous size",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole congregation broke out in a loud cry",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people wept through that dark and fearful night",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They grumbled against Moses and Aaron",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying if only we had died in Egypt",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why is the LORD bringing us to this land",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Only to fall by the sword and be plundered",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our wives and children would become the spoils",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So let us choose a leader and go back",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We even saw the descendants of Anak there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In our own eyes we seemed like grasshoppers",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land we traveled through devours the living",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And all the people we saw are of enormous size",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Caleb quieted the people before Moses",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying we should go up and take possession",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For we are well able to do it",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though the men with him said we cannot attack them",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We even saw the descendants of Anak there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In our own eyes we seemed like grasshoppers",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land we traveled through devours the living",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And all the people we saw are of enormous size",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Caleb drove out Sheshai, Ahiman, and Talmai",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hebron belonged to him as an inheritance",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because he followed the LORD wholeheartedly",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  }
 ],
